1
00:01:04,911 --> 00:01:12,555
The mass is done, they sing Amen, 
And suddenly she stands by me.

2
00:01:12,921 --> 00:01:20,588
She looks at me, then at the cross, 
And then her eyes turn back to me.

3
00:01:28,657 --> 00:01:36,674
Luna calls my name, she whispers Paul, 
The heavy church absorbs it all.

4
00:01:36,882 --> 00:01:48,558
Those moving lips, those silent words, 
An echo that was never heard!

5
00:02:00,935 --> 00:02:08,722
Your silent lips begin to part, 
My Lion weeps inside my heart.

6
00:02:08,904 --> 00:02:16,433
The Demon whispers: Let her go!, 
As icy tears begin to flow.

7
00:02:24,397 --> 00:02:32,717
Luna calls my name, she whispers Paul, 
The heavy church absorbs it all.

8
00:02:32,820 --> 00:02:44,415
Those moving lips, those silent words, 
An echo that was never heard!

9
00:04:00,632 --> 00:04:08,672
Did you say: Come and walk with me?, 
I will set you free?,

10
00:04:08,816 --> 00:04:21,087
I'll never know, eternally, 
A silent cage without a key...

11
00:04:24,654 --> 00:04:32,765
I stay behind in freezing cold, 
The candles fade, the story's told.

12
00:04:32,823 --> 00:04:46,476
For forty years I ask in vain: 
What were the words that caused this pain?

